{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shadows are the most dangerous creatures in the world. They are fast, they are strong, they have guns! You are a shadow hunter. You have weapons in your arsenal that can destroy a shadow, but that's not enough! You need to move quickly and dodge enemy attacks! Each level has a specific task to destroy the enemy. Somewhere you will have to use only grenades, somewhere only firearms... Enemies also come in different types, some attack at close range, some use weapons. Be careful and you will win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Genre of the game - survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feature:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dangerous enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491920?t=1740630622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491920?t=1740630622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491920/b4555795c763a4c28edc48cd020a1556826a5061/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740630622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491920/b4555795c763a4c28edc48cd020a1556826a5061/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740630622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shadows are the most dangerous creatures in the world. They are fast, they are strong, they have guns! You are a shadow hunter. You have weapons in your arsenal that can destroy a shadow, but that's not enough! You need to move quickly and dodge enemy attacks! Each level has a speci